      "title": "Model download",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## SD3.5 Medium Flat-Color Workflow\n\nSingle checkpoint (model+clip+vae bundled). Runs on 6GB VRAM.\n\n### Download (mirror for CN: hf-mirror.com)\n- **sd3.5_medium.safetensors** (~4.3 GB) -> models/checkpoints/\n  https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-3.5-medium/resolve/main/sd3.5_medium.safetensors\n\n### Notes\n- KSampler: steps=30, cfg=4.5, sampler=dpmpp_2m, scheduler=karras (SD3.5 defaults).\n- Negative prompt includes 'gradient, shadow, ambient occlusion' to suppress lighting.\n- ImageColorQuantize palette L8 keeps output as clean solid blocks.\n- Switch node 7 mode to 'cel' for harder 2-tone shading.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
